---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const schema = JSON.stringify([{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Tennis Court Flooring"
  }]);
---

<Layout title="Tennis Court Flooring: ITF-Certified Acrylic Surfaces | UWIN" description="Construct an ITF-certified tennis court in India. We supply and install 5-layer hard courts and 8-layer premium cushion acrylic systems. Direct pricing." schema={schema}>
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="pt-24 pb-16 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1E293B] mb-8">Tennis Court Flooring: ITF-Certified Acrylic Surfaces</h1>
      
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 rounded-r-lg mb-10 ai-snapshot">
        <strong>Snapshot:</strong> How much does a synthetic tennis court cost? Building an ITF-certified tennis court requires a level M20 concrete base followed by a 5-layer or 8-layer cushion acrylic coating. Pricing varies based on the number of cushion layers, which determine the court's pace and shock absorption.
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-slate-700">
        
    <h2>Building an ITF-Standard Tennis Court in India</h2>
    <div class="ai-snapshot bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-md mb-6 border-l-4 border-gray-400">
      <strong>What is the difference between a 5-layer and 8-layer acrylic tennis court?</strong> A 5-layer system is a standard hard court (primer, resurfacer, two color coats, lines). An 8-layer system adds three layers of milled SBR rubber cushion, providing superior shock absorption, slower court pace, and reduced joint stress.
    </div>
    
    <p>Tennis court construction is an exact science. The surface directly dictates the speed of the game, the height of the ball bounce, and the physical toll on the players' bodies. UWIN Floortech installs ITF-classified acrylic systems engineered to meet international tournament standards.</p>

    <h3>The 8-Layer Premium Cushion System</h3>
    <p>This is the benchmark for premium sports clubs and high-performance training academies. By integrating three distinct layers of rubberized cushion before the color coats, the surface absorbs significant impact energy. This protects players from the chronic knee and lower back injuries commonly associated with playing on raw concrete.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Court Pace:</strong> Classified as Slow to Medium-Slow by the ITF.</li>
      <li><strong>Player Safety:</strong> Maximum shock absorption for extended daily training.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>The 5-Layer Non-Cushion System</h3>
    <p>The standard workhorse for schools, universities, and residential real estate developers. It provides the grip, aesthetics, and true ball bounce of a professional court at a highly cost-effective price point.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Court Pace:</strong> Classified as Medium-Fast to Fast.</li>
      <li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> Highly durable, easily cleaned with water and mild detergent.</li>
    </ul>
  
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-2xl text-white text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to upgrade your sports infrastructure?</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-slate-300">Get manufacturer-direct pricing with zero middlemen markups. We supply and install Pan-India.</p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <a href="tel:+919821648112" class="bg-white text-[#1E293B] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">Call +91 98216 48112</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/919821648112" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-green-600 transition-colors">WhatsApp Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
